", "id": "1131539662327949", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831399_1131539665661282_3546996107121005662_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XLcYVePeu60Q7kNvwHXKuWd&_nc_oc=Ado6AP7weABZ4k3Zpzl-35YYhxPYm7mYVCYNfw3zIDpFciUaCr-hsF-nHalYC1ndAeY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8DJ-EBepqvyOniLYQgLPqNDqvqaB8jFY1J0Cz-agdfPQ&oe=6A2418CD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Certified Sterile Processing Technician", "keywords": ["VR", "Immerselearn", "Training", "CSPT"], "long_description": "Certified Sterile Processing Technician is an immersive VR training application designed to prepare users for critical responsibilities in sterile processing. Through realistic, hands-on simulation, learners practice key tasks such as instrument decontamination, sterilization techniques, equipment handling, and infection control. The app provides a safe, controlled environment to build competence and confidence\u2014perfect for healthcare students, vocational programs, or professionals preparing for certification or on-the-job training.", "short_description": "Certified Sterile Processing Technician is a VR training simulation that offers hands-on practice in essential sterilization and decontamination procedures. Learn and apply industry-standard techniques in a realistic, immersive environment\u2014ideal for students, trainees, and healthcare professionals."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://immerselearn.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ImmerseLearn", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://immerselearn.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "478089301798119"}, {"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED